     The vvffss__uunnbbuussyy() function un-busies a mount point by decrementing the
     reference count of a mount point.  The reference count is typically in‐
     cremented by calling vfs_busy(9) prior to this call.

     Its arguments are:

     _m_p  The mount point to unbusy.

